# Breezy Does It (levels/solo/breezy.txt): the awnings' tailwind, the ceiling-fan hall, the wind
# elevator, the bubble bath (drift column to column at the top of each bob), the updraft up to
# the roof and its holes, the big blow (awning, fan post, toot) and the plunger in the headwind.
